{"Name":"Media Circle (Parcel B) GLS","ShortName":"Media Circle (Parcel B) GLS","Description":"Media Circle (Parcel B) GLS spans approximately 107,936 sqft and can yield up to 485 units along with 400sqm of commercial space on the first storey of the development. Located in the tech-innovation hub of One-north, this presents a rare opportunity to create an integrated residential precinct for university staff, start-up professionals and international tenants.","StartUrl":"/","Display":"standalone","BackgroundColor":"#ffffff","ThemeColor":"#041e42","Orientation":"portrait","Icons":[{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/da7bdb8e-9f0b-4057-b575-e75ca8f819c1","Sizes":"192x192","Type":"image/png"},{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/da7bdb8e-9f0b-4057-b575-e75ca8f819c1","Sizes":"512x512","Type":"image/png"}]}